{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Decorate islands and build cute cat cities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kity Builder is a playful city-building sandbox about building settlements and cities for cats! Create beautiful settlements on different-sized and themed islands and watch as \u2018kitizens\u2019 move in and make themselves at home.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/ciudades.gif?t=1746221515\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Every building is a toy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buildings double as toys to help you further explore the island. Climb, jump, and fling yourself through the air on a quest to discover every hidden nook and cranny. Collect blue(paw)prints and unlock new things to build. And don\u2019t worry, you\u2019re not alone \u2013 you\u2019ll have help from Mayor Mewyor, alongside a cast of strange, loveable kitties!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/juguetes.gif?t=1746221515\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>No limits. No pressure.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Without time limits, resources or even money, Kity Builder is all about the pure fun of creating. Move at your own pace and watch your city grow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/construir.gif?t=1746221515\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a city for kitties in an adorable island sandbox!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb, bounce and leap to new heights as you explore the island!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet a zany cast of cat-characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create to your heart\u2019s content without timers or 